course: dictionary
lesson: 14827
title: Quizmaster: the person who runs the quiz
level: primary-4
stars: 1
explain: A quizmaster is the person who runs a quiz. You can work out the meaning from the words around it. «The quizmaster read out the first question, and the room went quiet.» Quiz tells you there are questions, and the quizmaster is the one reading them out.
explain: «The quizmaster added up the scores and announced the winners.» Keeping the score and saying who has won are the quizmaster's jobs. Check your meaning by swapping it in: "the person who asks the questions added up the scores" still makes sense, so you are on the right track.
explain: A quizmaster can be a teacher, a friend, or a host on TV. «Our quizmaster was strict, but she made us laugh.» Here strict tells you what this quizmaster was like, while the quizmaster's job stayed the same.
fact: A quizmaster is the person who asks the questions in a quiz.
fact: The quizmaster also keeps the score and says who has won.
fact: Quizmaster is a noun. Its plural is quizmasters.
fact: In a pub quiz or on a TV quiz show, the quizmaster often reads out the questions.
fact: The phrase «act as quizmaster» means to run the quiz for everyone else.
exercise: «The quizmaster read out the first question.» What is a quizmaster? | *The person who asks the questions in a quiz | The person who wins every prize | A question written on the board | A quiz with pictures only
exercise: Which job belongs to the quizmaster? | Painting the classroom walls | Carrying the chairs out | *Keeping the score | Eating the snacks before the quiz starts
exercise: Which word means the person who asks the questions in a quiz? | quiz show | question | *quizmaster | scores
test: «The quizmaster announced that our team had won the class quiz.» What does the quizmaster do in this sentence? | Hands out the books | Draws a picture of each team | Cooks the lunch for the class | *Says who has won
test: What is the plural of quizmaster? | *quizmasters | quizmasterss | quizmaster's | quizmastering
exam: Mia will act as quizmaster for the end-of-term quiz. What does act as quizmaster mean? | To take part as a team member | To write the answers on the back of a card | To cook food for the quiz night | *To run the quiz, asking questions and keeping score
